WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:03.000
Do you want to change things?

00:00:03.000 --> 00:00:07.000
Make a party and win the elections.

00:00:15.000 --> 00:00:17.000
I didn't get in here to be guiding lambs.

00:00:17.000 --> 00:00:21.000
I got in here to wake up lions!

00:00:23.000 --> 00:00:25.000
I want to hear it from you!

00:00:25.000 --> 00:00:32.000
He says the caste is afraid. Who has you, Viero?

00:00:42.000 --> 00:00:47.000
Mileli makes a lot of noodles but he lacks the tucco.

00:00:47.000 --> 00:00:53.000
To fix inflation you have to align, align and TAK!

00:00:53.000 --> 00:00:57.000
Milegi is unprecedented.

00:00:57.000 --> 00:01:00.000
It's a varial phenomenon.

00:01:01.000 --> 00:01:03.000
Don't give him a chance.

00:01:03.000 --> 00:01:07.000
Please, save this country.

00:01:08.000 --> 00:01:11.000
We're in this. Stay calm.

00:01:15.000 --> 00:01:19.000
He threatened me. He said he was going to step on me with his wheelchair.

00:01:19.000 --> 00:01:21.000
And that he was going to beat me.

00:01:21.000 --> 00:01:22.000
I can't believe it!

00:01:22.500 --> 00:01:24.000
This is a barbarity!

00:01:24.000 --> 00:01:25.000
He's a lunatic!

00:01:25.000 --> 00:01:26.500
He's not a lion!

00:01:28.000 --> 00:01:31.500
He's a little cat of economic power!

00:01:38.500 --> 00:01:40.500
I should have always supported you.

00:01:47.000 --> 00:01:48.500
For yes or for no...

00:01:48.500 --> 00:01:52.500
You're going to sell organs?

00:01:58.500 --> 00:02:01.500
For yes or no, you're president!

00:02:08.500 --> 00:02:10.500
It seems so.

00:02:11.500 --> 00:02:15.500
Hello everyone, I'm the lion!

00:02:15.500 --> 00:02:19.500
Ruggio the beast in the middle of the avenue
